snippet.description:
I've been wanting to activate US-2376 for a long time and finally got it done.  I was heading to Shreveport for the Shreveport-Bossier Hamfest.  I took the opportunity to activate a few parks along the way.  South Toledo Bend State Park was first on the list.  It was almost like the summer doldrums were over as the band conditions were fantastic.  The Spooltenna EFHW performed like a Champion.  Come along for a really fun activation that starts with a contact with @HamRadioAdventureGuy followed by a call from a SOTA summit in California.  It just doesn't get much better.

